ompanied by her faithful companion Crocus: the dog that her parents gave her to keep her company. She will relive her best memories with him!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592780/extras/db033c7f2b6efb7dfab438784dc557ea.poster.avif?t=1700733775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592780/extras/db033c7f2b6efb7dfab438784dc557ea.webm?t=1700733775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592780/extras/db033c7f2b6efb7dfab438784dc557ea.mp4?t=1700733775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592780/extras/9e2ec8676333bd8e75b49c5fcee1563e.avif?t=1700733775\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Diegetic narration and storytelling helping the player<br></li><li> Cute and adorable story relating a unique journey in the shoes of a child<br></li><li> Experience a little girl's imagination beautifying the real world<br></li><li> Simple gameplay mechanics in relation with the narration<br></li><li> Awesome sound effects and music for a better immersion<br></li><li> Collectibles : find and pick-up Elif and Crocus\u2019 memories to learn more about them or new exciting stories<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592780/extras/22f5783a082e82400606db2392d308ea.poster.avif?t=1700733775\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1592780/extras/22f5783a082e82400606db2392d308ea.webm?t=1700733775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1